-    $$ u_j = 2^{\frac{j-N/2}{N/2-1}}, \quad j \in \{1, \dots, N/2\} $$
-    The final set of sample positions $\mathbf{x}$ is derived from these offsets relative to $A$ and direction $\vec{d}$ [S1].
